* AT89S52 - Simple RC Reset Simulation

* Power supply: 0V to 5V in 1ms
VDD vdd 0 PWL(0 0 1m 5 20m 5)

* RC reset network
R1 rst 0 10k
C1 vdd rst 100u

* Transient analysis
.tran 10u 150m

* Plot results
.control
meas tran t_release WHEN v(rst)=2.5 FALL=1
print t_release
run
plot v(vdd) v(rst)
.endc

.end

